Rescue opsunderway after a bridge collapsed amid heavy rainfall in Darjeeling. PT!

@At least 20 people died in West Bengal's Darjeeling, Kalimpong and Kurseong districts after landslides swept away homes, roads and bridges. m@ PM Narendra Modi said the Centre will provide all possible assistance. CM Mamata Banerjee will visit the hill districts Monday. PAGES3,5

1 2 to 4 players choose a colour. 2 Each player moves 4 tokens around the Ludo board, aiming to reach the SMART INVESTOR'S HOME. 3 Tokens move based on dice rolls; a 6 lets tokens exit home and grants an extra turn. 4 The board has SCAM and GOOD PRACTICES squares scattered along the path. § Landing on a SCAM square moves the player's token backward by 2 squares. 6 Landing on a GOOD PRACTICES square moves the token forward by 2 squares. 7 Landing on an opponent's token doesn't send back their token to their home. Instead, both the colour tokens continue going their own way. 8 The first player moving all tokens to their home area wins.
